d 'MCHAID': module to perform  Chi-square automated interaction detection (CHAID) for a categorical response variable
d
d    mchaid grows a CHAID decision tree for a categorical response
d variable: it merges	 the categories of the splitting variables
d and splits the data into nodes that	 differ as much as possible
d in the distribution of the response variable.  It is a    faster,
d corrected version of chaid, and shows the tree in a table and in
d a graph.    maid performs Automatic interaction detection with F
d tests (MAID): CHAID tree for a	       quantitative
d response variable 
d
d KW: CHAID
d KW: decision tree
d
d Requires: Stata version 12.1 and moremata from SSC (q.v.)
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261125
d
d Author: Modesto Escobar,  Universidad de Salamanca
d Support: email modesto@@usal.es
d
f mchaid.ado
f mchaid.sthlp
f maid.ado
f maid.sthlp
f mchaid_d3_js.ado
f mchaid_estat.ado
f mchaid_tree_css.ado
f mchaid_tree_js.ado
